#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:146
msgid "Load Balancer Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Balanceador de Carga"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:148
msgid "When placing a load balancer in front of the RabbitMQ cluster:"
msgstr "Ao colocar um balanceador de carga na frente do cluster RabbitMQ:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:150
msgid "Forward **port 5672** (AMQP) with TCP mode (not HTTP)"
msgstr "Encaminhe a **porta 5672** (AMQP) em modo TCP (não HTTP)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:151
msgid "Forward **port 61613** (STOMP) with TCP mode"
msgstr "Encaminhe a **porta 61613** (STOMP) em modo TCP"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:152
msgid "Use **round-robin** or **least-connections** balancing"
msgstr "Use balanceamento **round-robin** ou **least-connections**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:153
msgid ""
"Configure health checks against the RabbitMQ management API (port 15672, "
"path ``/api/health/checks/alarms``) or a simple TCP check on port 5672"
msgstr "Configure verificações de status em relação à API de gerenciamento do RabbitMQ (porta 15672, caminho ``/api/health/checks/alarms``) ou uma verificação TCP simples na porta 5672"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:154
msgid ""
"Ensure the load balancer supports **long-lived connections** — STOMP "
"agent connections are persistent"
msgstr "Garanta que o balanceador de carga suporte **conexões de longa duração** — as conexões STOMP do agente são persistentes"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:157
msgid "TLS Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração TLS"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:159
msgid "To secure RabbitMQ communications with TLS:"
msgstr "Para proteger as comunicações do RabbitMQ com TLS:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:161
msgid ""
"Configure RabbitMQ with TLS certificates (see `RabbitMQ TLS documentation"
" <https://www.rabbitmq.com/ssl.html>`_)"
msgstr "Configure o RabbitMQ com certificados TLS (consulte a `documentação TLS do RabbitMQ <https://www.rabbitmq.com/ssl.html>`_)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:162
msgid "Use TLS-enabled ports (typically 5671 for AMQPS, 61614 for STOMP over TLS)"
msgstr "Use portas com TLS ativado (tipicamente 5671 para AMQPS, 61614 para STOMP sobre TLS)"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:163
msgid ""
"Update the |morpheus| ``morpheus.rb`` configuration to point at the TLS "
"ports and enable SSL for the connection"
msgstr "Atualize a configuração ``morpheus.rb`` do |morpheus| para apontar para as portas TLS e ativar SSL na conexão"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:166
msgid "Memory and Resource Sizing"
msgstr "Dimensionamento de Memória e Recursos"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:168
msgid "RabbitMQ resource requirements depend on message throughput:"
msgstr "Os requisitos de recursos do RabbitMQ dependem da taxa de transferência de mensagens:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:170
msgid "**Small environments** (< 100 agents): 2 GB RAM per node"
msgstr "**Ambientes pequenos** (< 100 agentes): 2 GB de RAM por nó"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:171
msgid "**Medium environments** (100–1000 agents): 4 GB RAM per node"
msgstr "**Ambientes médios** (100–1000 agentes): 4 GB de RAM por nó"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:172
msgid ""
"**Large environments** (1000+ agents): 8 GB RAM per node, consider "
"dedicated I/O-optimized storage for message persistence"
msgstr "**Ambientes grandes** (1000+ agentes): 8 GB de RAM por nó; considere armazenamento dedicado otimizado para E/S para persistência de mensagens"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:174
msgid ""
"Monitor queue depths and memory usage via the RabbitMQ Management UI "
"(port 15672, enable with ``rabbitmq-plugins enable "
"rabbitmq_management``)."
msgstr "Monitore a profundidade das filas e o uso de memória pela UI de Gerenciamento do RabbitMQ (porta 15672; ative com ``rabbitmq-plugins enable rabbitmq_management``)."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:177
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solução de problemas"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:179
msgid "**Cluster partition (split-brain)**"
msgstr "**Partição do cluster (split-brain)**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:181
msgid ""
"If network issues cause a cluster partition, RabbitMQ nodes may disagree "
"on cluster state. Resolution:"
msgstr "Se problemas de rede causarem uma partição do cluster, os nós RabbitMQ podem discordar sobre o estado do cluster. Resolução:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:183
msgid ""
"# On the minority-side node(s):\n"
"rabbitmqctl stop_app\n"
"rabbitmqctl reset\n"
"rabbitmqctl join_cluster rabbit@<majority-node>\n"
"rabbitmqctl start_app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:191
msgid "**Agent connection failures**"
msgstr "**Falhas de conexão do agente**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:193
msgid "If agents cannot connect to |morpheus| after externalizing RabbitMQ:"
msgstr "Se os agentes não puderem se conectar ao |morpheus| após externalizar o RabbitMQ:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:195
msgid ""
"Verify port 61613 (STOMP) is open from agent hosts to the RabbitMQ "
"cluster/load balancer"
msgstr "Verifique se a porta 61613 (STOMP) está aberta dos hosts do agente até o cluster/balanceador de carga RabbitMQ"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:196
msgid ""
"Check the appliance URL is correctly configured in |AdmSet| — agents use "
"this to determine the STOMP connection endpoint"
msgstr "Verifique se a URL do appliance está configurada corretamente em |AdmSet| — os agentes a usam para determinar o endpoint de conexão STOMP"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:197
msgid "Verify the ``morpheus`` user has permissions on the ``morpheus`` vhost"
msgstr "Verifique se o usuário ``morpheus`` tem permissões no vhost ``morpheus``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:199
msgid "**High memory watermark**"
msgstr "**Limite alto de memória (high memory watermark)**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:201
msgid "If RabbitMQ triggers its high memory watermark and blocks publishers:"
msgstr "Se o RabbitMQ acionar seu limite alto de memória e bloquear publicadores:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:203
msgid ""
"Increase the memory limit: ``rabbitmqctl set_vm_memory_high_watermark "
"0.6``"
msgstr "Aumente o limite de memória: ``rabbitmqctl set_vm_memory_high_watermark 0.6``"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:204
msgid "Add more RAM to the nodes"
msgstr "Adicione mais RAM aos nós"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:205
msgid ""
"Investigate consumers that may be offline or slow (check queue depths in "
"the Management UI)"
msgstr "Investigue consumidores que possam estar offline ou lentos (verifique a profundidade das filas na UI de Gerenciamento)"

